"description":"If you’re enjoying your golden years, retirement, grandkids and golf – this is the app for you. \n\nIn your free app account, you’ll find three paths ready to guide you to the answers you need today to get ready for all that lies ahead – saving you and your family from a ton of stress and uncertainty down the road:\n \nLife & Vitality - Map out a fulfilling retirement of quality & longevity.\nHealth & Care - Design around your future needs to get the care you want later.\nFinal Wishes - Plan your legacy so loved ones know just how to honor your life.  \n\nEverdays plans are really powerful, because not only are they grounded in your decisions, they’re also protected by the right insurance. We partner with reputable, A+ rated insurance providers to bring you our custom Senior Insurance, which transforms your plans from nice ideas into meaningful action. Uniquely designed coverage options are based on your plans, and are tailored to your needs to protect your future and your family. \n\nHere’s how it works: \nFirst, download the app to set up your free account and answer simple questions about your preferences.\nThen, we’ll create your digital plans and save them to your account, where you can make updates or share with loved ones any time. \nAnd when you’re ready, secure your plans with the right insurance to meet your needs – all from within your account. \n\nThere’s a new, fulfilling life over 60 just waiting for you. Now’s the time to plan ahead and make sure it happens.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.62096999999999979991116560995578765869140625, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"51815424", "formattedPrice":"Free", "trackContentRating":"4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":992, "bundleId":"com.izimobile.requiem", "trackCensoredName":"Everdays: Retirement Planning", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/everdays-retirement-planning/id1123339295?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.620969999999999