"description":"Secure Your Legacy. Support Your Loved Ones.\nIQ121 is the end of life planning app designed to bring comfort, clarity, and control to the most personal moments of life. With IQ121, you can organize, store, and protect your most important documents, digital assets, and personal wishes all in one secure, easy-to-use platform.\nWe understand that grief, loss, and uncertainty are deeply emotional experiences. That’s why IQ121 was built with empathy at its core - to ensure your loved ones are supported and guided when it matters most.\nWhether you're creating a plan for yourself or helping a family member prepare, IQ121 empowers you to handle the details with dignity and peace of mind.\nEverything You Need, All in One Place\nDigital Vault\nStore essential documents, legal forms, insurance policies, and assets in one secure location: accessible when your loved ones need it most.\nComprehensive Planner\nCover everything from wills and benefits to care preferences, funeral wishes, and financial instructions organized step by step for ease and clarity.\nLegacy Organizer\nPreserve personal messages, photos, and memories to share your life story and emotional legacy with the people who matter most.\nSecure and Private\nYour data is encrypted and stored with industry-leading security protocols. IQ121 ensures your information stays private, protected, and accessible only by those you trust.\nGuided Planning for Loved Ones\nHelp your family avoid confusion, paperwork, and stress. IQ121 simplifies communication and provides the tools they’ll need during times of grief and loss.\nWhy IQ121\nDesigned by experts in end of life planning and digital protection\n\n\nBuilt with compassion to support real families and their futures\n\n\nHelps reduce emotional and financial stress for your loved ones\n\n\nEncourages thoughtful preparation and meaningful legacy sharing\n\n\nEnables easy updates — because life and plans evolve\n\n\nSupport When It Matters Most\nPlanning for the future isn’t always easy, but it’s one of the greatest gifts you can offer your family. IQ121 turns a difficult task into a guided, intuitive experience, ensuring your voice is heard, your wishes are honored, and your legacy is preserved with love.\nWhether you're managing aging parent care, organizing your own affairs, or simply preparing for the unknown, IQ121 is your partner in compassionate planning.\n\nDownload IQ121 and take control of your legacy — one secure step at a time.\nTerms of Use: https://www.iq121.com/terms.html", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.25, "languageCodesISO2A":["AR", "EN", "JA", "PT", "RU", "ZH", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"163009536", "formattedPrice":"Free", "trackContentRating":"17+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":8, "bundleId":"com.iq.iq121", "trackCensoredName":"IQ121: Legacy Planner, Storage", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/iq121-legacy-planner-storage/id6476048879?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.25, "price":0.00, "genres":["Productivity"], "trackId":6476048879, "trackName":"IQ121: Legacy Planner, Storage", "userRatingCount":8}, 
