"description":"Learn something new in just 5 minutes a day with carefully curated ideas from the world's most popular books, presented through beautiful art and a delightfully focused reading experience.\n\nStop Scrolling Social Media -> Download Deepstash -> Use it for 5 min/day -> Become the smartest person in the room.\n\nJoin 11 million+ people discovering powerful insights from books like Atomic Habits, The Psychology of Money, Think and Grow Rich, and hundreds more, all distilled into bite-sized ideas you can read at a glance.\n\n------\n\nWHAT MAKES DEEPSTASH DIFFERENT\n\nKnowledge in Deepstash comes as beautifully designed idea cards: short, visual notes that condense profound thoughts from bestselling books into simple, memorable insights. Each idea is paired with stunning artwork that makes learning feel less like work and more like inspiration.\n\nNo clutter. No distractions. Just focused, delightful content that helps you grow smarter every day.\n\n------\n\nWHAT IDEAS CAN DO FOR YOU\n\nIdeas are fundamental to your wellbeing, your success, and your career. Reading powerful ideas daily can make you:\n\n- Smarter (you'll know more valuable concepts)\n- More Creative (you can connect more dots)\n- Happier (better habits, less anxiety)\n\nFuel your curiosity and get smarter daily.\n\n------\n\nPERSONALIZED CONTENT & FEEDS\n\nChoose topics you care about: productivity, leadership, psychology, philosophy, marketing, and more. As you read and save ideas, we learn what resonates with you and surface the best of our curated library of insights from top books.\n\nYou don't even have to work for it. We refresh your recommendations multiple times a day so you never run out of fresh ideas.\n\n------\n\nFREE & PRO: WHAT'S THE DIFFERENCE?\n\n- Start Free\nAccess 200,000+ powerful ideas from top books, articles, podcasts, and videos\nCreate and share your own ideas\n\n- Upgrade to Deepstash Pro\nNo Ads: Read without interruptions\nListen & Grow: Audio playback for all ideas\nDownload Your Ideas: Access your library offline\nUnlimited History: Go back to everything you've read, organized by day\n\n------\n\nBUILD YOUR PERSONAL KNOWLEDGE LIBRARY\n\nSave ideas that matter to you and organize them into collections. Create stashes for work projects, personal growth goals, or topics you're passionate about. Search and filter your saved ideas anytime, so they're always at hand when you need them.\n\n------\n\nSHARE YOUR DISCOVERIES\n\nFound an idea worth spreading? Share it with friends on WhatsApp, Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, or Quora. The Deepstash bite-sized format is perfect for sparking conversations.\n\n------\n\nWHY OUR USERS LOVE DEEPSTASH:\n\n\"It helped me get off social media. So excellent to learn something, and I feel like the time I spent was valuable. I also spend about 10 minutes every morning picking a topic and enjoying it. Great app, well-done Kudos\" - Ron Ronald\n\n\"Even five minutes a day will improve your thinking. I've come across new ideas and learnt to improve existing ways to become more motivated, confident and happier.\" - Ghazala Begum\n\n------\n\nWHAT THE MEDIA IS SAYING ABOUT US:\n\n\"Learn good habits, health practices, and more on your time. Makes personal growth manageable\" - Mashable\n\n\"More than 200,000 game-changing ideas at your fingertips\" - MacWorld\n\n\"Deepstash is perfect for entrepreneurs who want to stay updated but are short on time.\" - Entrepreneur.com\n\n------\n\nGood for your career.\nGreat for your life.\nGive it a shot!\n\nRead more about our terms and conditions here:\n\nTerms of service: https://deepstash.com/terms-of-service\nPrivacy policy: https://deepstash.com/privacy-policy", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.68703000000000002955857780762016773223876953125, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "FR", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"167453696", "formattedPrice":"Free", "trackContentRating":"4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":86255, "sellerUrl":"https://deepstash.com/", "bundleId":"com.deepstash.application", "trackCensoredName":"Deepstash: Smarter Every Day!", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/deepstash-smarter-every-day/id1445023295?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.68703000000000002955857780762016773223876953125, "price":0.00, "genres":["Education", "Books"], "trackId":1445023295, "trackName":"Deepstash: Smarter Every Day!", "userRatingCount":86255}]
